          <p>
            Power source is the last split. Most stand-mounted airless and HVLP turbine units plug into a wall outlet and run as long as you have paint. Cordless handhelds trade runtime for convenience, which is great for a door or a railing and frustrating for a full room. If you already own a battery platform that a sprayer supports, the cordless premium shrinks considerably.
          </p>
